[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0000","text":"旁白"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0010","text":"伫立在街角的咖啡店『片刻时光』\n店长和店员，今天看起来相当忙碌"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0001","text":"旁白"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0020","text":"也许是SNS的效果，\n客人确实多了起来……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0002","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0030","text":"你好～\n要一个泡芙，再来一杯今日推荐咖啡～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0003","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0040","text":"好的……\n咖啡……需要加牛奶和糖吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0004","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0050","text":"请加一下～\n……嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0005","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0060","text":"……比之前稍微\n客人变多了呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0006","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0070","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0007","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0080","text":"开了社交账号……\n然后……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0008","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0090","text":"嗯——\n社交账号，效果不错呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0009","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0100","text":"那个……是有人给我建议……才做的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0011","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0110","text":"这样啊\n呵呵，加油哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0012","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0120","text":"小理子～，热腾腾的拿波里意面做好了哦！\n帮忙端给客人～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0013","text":"理子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0130","text":"！\n不好意思……我先失陪了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0014","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0140","text":"不用在意我——\n忙起来是好事嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0142","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0015","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0150","text":"多谢款待"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0016","text":"时尚大学生&编辑"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0160","text":"……！？／哇……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0017","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0170","text":"啊——……不好意思……\n我这就捡起来……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0018","text":"编辑"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0180","text":"哪里哪里！\n我才该说抱歉，您没受伤吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0019","text":"时尚的大学生"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0190","text":"啊，那倒是没事\n不过文件和资料什么的，散了一地……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0021","text":"编辑"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0200","text":"啊哈哈，得赶紧捡起来才行呢\n都堵住门口了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_02_0201","text":"Motion"}]
